# Per-clip out-of-fold predictions: EVERY headline statistic in Chapter 6 and Chapter 7 is
# computed from these (clustered bootstrap, exact McNemar, the G19 placebo seeds). Without them
# in the repository a reader cannot verify a single adjudicated number, so they are kept despite
# the blanket rule above. ~7.4 MB over 50 files.
!sweep_results/**/*_oof.json
!sweep_results/ablations/calibration_holdout.json
!sweep_results/ablations/retrain.json
