# Phase 02 detector training outputs. Entry-form (not `sweep_results/entity_detector/`) so the
# negations below take effect: the 19-38 MB checkpoints and the PNG curve plots stay ignored, but
# the four text artifacts the thesis cites by name are kept. Chapter 4 (4.5.5, note under Table
# 4.1) and Chapter 7 (7.7.1(a)) both rest on them: train_run.log carries the ultralytics banner
# that adjudicates the host CPU label (`MPS (Apple M3)`) AND the mAP@50 = 0 validation rows that
# show the MPS/AdamW run collapsed, args.yaml records that run's `device: mps`, and
# stage1_frozen/results.csv is the 3-epoch / 0.462 mAP record. Without them a reader cannot check
# either disclosure. ~3.0 MB total.
sweep_results/entity_detector/*
!sweep_results/entity_detector/train_run.log
!sweep_results/entity_detector/quick_check.log
!sweep_results/entity_detector/reval-*.log
!sweep_results/entity_detector/stage1_frozen/
sweep_results/entity_detector/stage1_frozen/*
!sweep_results/entity_detector/stage1_frozen/results.csv
!sweep_results/entity_detector/stage1_frozen/args.yaml

